# Errors (rolling inbox)

Cross-round errors captured during implementation. Promote to `docs/memory/cases/` when reusable.

Entry format:

```
## [ERR-YYYYMMDD-XXX] skill_or_command_name
**Logged**: ISO-8601 timestamp
**Priority**: low | medium | high | critical
**Status**: pending | in_progress | resolved | wont_fix | promoted
### Summary
### Error
### Context
### Suggested Fix
```
